{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811","id":3529547853,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6ufEtM","number":111811,"title":"Fix switch to GameView when closing game window","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/23","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/23/labels","id":12939969,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AxXLB","number":23,"title":"4.6","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2978,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-05-22T16:25:52Z","updated_at":"2026-10-04T16:23:23Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-01-26T18:09:14Z"},"comments":9,"created_at":"2025-10-19T05:56:19Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:35:54Z","closed_at":"2026-01-05T11:08:48Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111811","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111811.patch","merged_at":"2026-01-05T11:08:48Z"},"body":"- *Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110840*\r\n\r\n## Issue Description\r\n\r\nGodot added a function to jump to GameView for debugging at Dec 30, 2024.\r\n\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100916\r\n- https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/100902\r\n\r\nThis feature add a timer into `embedded_process` to watch whether the `EDITOR_GAME` focused. This time will be triggered each `0.1 second`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L497-L501\r\n\r\nIt will switch to `EDITOR_GAME` when `get_window_enabled() == false`.\r\n\r\nWhen we close testing game window, it will trigger `_window_close_request()`.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/7864ac80192e9e91bf56176af9f04cc013b580aa/editor/run/game_view_plugin.cpp#L1071-L1092\r\n\r\nAt first, we invoke `set_window_enabled(false)`, then consider to invoke `embedded_process.reset()`. Unfortunately, when the condition doesnot match, e.g. `is_embedding_completed`, we wont `reset` `embedded_process` immediately. That  makes the timer keep alive for a short time.\r\n\r\nIf the timer success trigger a signal in that short time, it will find `get_window_enabled()` is false, and control editor switch to `EDITOR_GAME`. \r\n\r\nSo, invoke `reset()` before `set_enabled(false)` can solve this issue.\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111811/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}